      "title": "Brellum Pilot 39 Power Reserve: 39 mm, COSC e 46 peças a CHF 3.390",
      "category": "Alta Relojoaria",
      "categorySlug": "relogios",
      "category_slug": "relogios",
      "authorSlug": "clara-meirelles",
